# Biome 1, level 16 — Three Kinds
#
# Water, wind and crystal on one board for the first time. Three springs along the top, three hubs
# scattered, and no cell to spare: the shape is the three routes and nothing else.
#
# Best play is 499 — 182, 182 and 135 — and the target of 480 needs all three. Two routes cannot
# reach it however well they are built, which is the point: this board is about serving everything
# rather than serving one thing perfectly.

